# Firewall of the primary PostgreSQL (data 172.28.3.40).
# booking works with the data; the standby connects to copy every change.
# The primary itself connects to nobody.
# direction  peer          port  rule name
in           172.28.3.20   5432  booking-to-postgres
in           172.28.3.41   5432  standby-replicates-from-primary
